<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Results Interpretation | Bolt Compass</title>

    <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/tippy.js@6/animations/scale.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">

    <style>
        .match-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: white;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .match-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.1);
        }
        .match-info h4 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0; color: #0f172a; }
        .match-info p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .match-score {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="header-placeholder"></div>

    <main>
        <section class="container" style="padding-top: 4rem;">
            <div data-aos="fade-up">
                <h1 style="color: var(--accent-blue);">Results Interpretation Logic</h1>
                <p>The final phase of the algorithm involves translating raw intelligence vectors into actionable career data. This page documents the heuristic rules mapping scores to career pathways.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="chart-container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <h2>Career Matching Heuristics</h2>
                <p>Career recommendations are conditionally triggered when a specific intelligence category achieves an average score of <span class="tooltip-trigger" data-tippy-content="The established threshold to indicate primary aptitude.">3.5 or higher</span>. Once triggered, the score (e.g., 4.2) is mapped to a deterministic percentage (e.g., 84%) rather than generating randomized strings.</p>

                <div style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 2rem;">
                    <h3>Threshold Activation Logic</h3>
                    <pre style="background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; overflow-x: auto;">
if (averageScore[Category] >= 3.5) {
    const matchPercentage = (averageScore[Category] / 5.0) * 100;
    triggerCareerRecommendations(Category, matchPercentage);
}</pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
                <h2>Top 5 Match Constraint</h2>
                <p>To prevent cognitive overload, the application's dashboard logic is hard-coded to return strictly the <strong>Top 5 highest percentage matches</strong>, regardless of how many vectors cleared the 3.5 threshold. This enforces signal over noise.</p>

                <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                    <div class="match-card">
                        <div class="match-info">
                            <h4>Data Scientist</h4>
                            <p>Primary Vector: Logical-Mathematical</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="match-score">94%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="match-card">
                        <div class="match-info">
                            <h4>Systems Architect</h4>
                            <p>Primary Vector: Visual-Spatial & Logical</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="match-score">88%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="match-card">
                        <div class="match-info">
                            <h4>Technical Product Manager</h4>
                            <p>Primary Vector: Interpersonal & Logical</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="match-score">82%</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400" style="margin-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h2>Historical Progress Tracking</h2>
                <p>By persisting assessments to a JSONB-backed Postgres table via Supabase, the application calculates chronological delta scores. Improvement tracking triggers when:</p>
                <div class="formula-block" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                    Latest Score - Baseline Score > 0.3
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <div id="footer-placeholder"></div>

    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@popperjs/core@2"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/tippy.js@6"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.js"></script>
    <script src="components.js"></script>
    <script src="scripts.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
